the account Nadia runs\" reported the Carrier_Dwell_Summary export dropping Dock Door 9 timestamps. The digest doesn't name the account, so I haven't counted it. If that was Vantorre Group, add it.\n\nOther notes:\n- Moss's other Strategic digests and the cheat sheet mention Vantorre Group but give no ticket numbers. Vantorre Mobility's #4812 (digest 2025-03-10) is excluded.\n- I can only see the channels and digests. I don't have the ticket system itself, so this isn't a verified full history and statuses may be out of date.","thread_ts":"1792159200.000125"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1792159200.000126","thread_ts":"1792159200.000125"}}
